    11feaa1d54404a13 t("Every surface is a cell grid of JetBrains Mono 14 at line height 1.25, with no radius and no soft shadow. Colour means status. Box-drawing rules replace borders, inverse video marks focus, and the silver DOS face is kept for the menu, the dialog and the key-bar labels. Tokens live in Styles/fork-tree.ds; hooks/look.ts mirrors the status roles.",Manrope,14,r,align(l),lh(1.5)) p(0,46.41) s(760,hug:63) f[(f37c5377a50adc29,tok(color.text.secondary,#C5C5C9))] $typography.doc.body "Text 251"
